Make sure you have Python(>=3.12) installed on your machine. Follow the steps below to setup the environment and run the code:

1) Create and activate the python environment:

python -m venv ./genai-sql
source genai-sql/bin/activate
pip install -r requirements.txt

2) Open the prompt-llm.py script and update the "query" variable (at line 63) value with your specific input query, 


3) Call the prompt-llm.py script as folows: 

python prompt-llm.py -prompt <path-to-prompt-file> -key <path-to-open-ai-key-file>

Eg run: python prompt-llm.py -prompt ./gift-prompt -key ./openai-key

4) To change the OpenAI model used, set the variable "model_name" (at line 26). Gpt5 does not allow setting the temperature parameter, you will need to remove it. 

